hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1681","###
 Narrated to us Muhammad bin Rafi', he said: Narrated to us An-Nadr bin Shumayl, on the authority of Thabit bin Umamah al-Hanafi, on the authority of Ghunaym bin Qays, on the authority of Abu Musa al-Ash'ari (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said, ""Any woman who applies perfume and then passes by a group of people so that they may smell her fragrance, she is a fornicator (Zaniyah), and every eye"
